## 3. Canonical serialization vectors

Voor ieder testobject bewaren we:

```text
INPUT RECORD
    ↓
EXPECTED CANONICAL REPRESENTATION
    ↓
EXPECTED CANONICAL BYTES
    ↓
EXPECTED HASH
    ↓
EXPECTED SIGNATURE
```

Een vector bevat minimaal:

```text
vector_id
protocol_version
domain
object_type
input_record
canonical_bytes
hash_algorithm
payload_hash
signature_algorithm
key_id
signature
expected_result
```

Test:

```text
record
   ↓
canonical_encode(record)
   ↓
expected_bytes
```

Moet exact zijn:

```text
actual_bytes == expected_bytes
```

Niet:

```text
semantically_equal(actual, expected)
```

